{"n":5,"title":"The family group chat","blurb":"Рассказывать о своей семье","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"note","title":"The family group chat","sub":"","html":"<p>Кто есть кто в твоей семье — и чья это собака.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Называть членов семьи</li><li>Говорить, чьё это: my, his, her, their</li><li>Использовать 's: my brother's wife</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Выберите, кто есть в вашей семье.","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"mother"},{"label":"father"},{"label":"sister"},{"label":"brother"},{"label":"son"},{"label":"daughter"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"family","ru":"семья","kk":"отбасы","def":"This is my family.","img":"/course/a0/img/l5-family.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/c33f059b0ca7.mp3"},{"en":"father","ru":"отец","kk":"әке","def":"Derek is Anna's father.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/eecfa292d39d.mp3"},{"en":"mother","ru":"мать","kk":"ана","def":"Carol is her mother.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/697b17244867.mp3"},{"en":"parents","ru":"родители","kk":"ата-ана","def":"My parents are teachers.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/2e9c8b4c4113.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"match","title":"Соедините пары.","sub":"","pairs":[{"left":"father","right":"mother"},{"left":"son","right":"daughter"},{"left":"brother","right":"sister"},{"left":"husband","right":"wife"}],"options":["wife","sister","daughter","mother"]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"son","ru":"сын","kk":"ұл","def":"Fergus is their son.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/ea9c8efe30fd.mp3"},{"en":"daughter","ru":"дочь","kk":"қыз","def":"Olivia is their daughter.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/b890a931c286.mp3"},{"en":"children","ru":"дети","kk":"балалар","def":"They have two children.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/21b162d3f9ec.mp3"},{"en":"brother","ru":"брат","kk":"аға / іні","def":"Andy is her brother.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/8bb28da7a245.mp3"},{"en":"sister","ru":"сестра","kk":"апа / қарындас","def":"I have two sisters.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/4fd9c7eef340.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"My father and my mother are my","after":".","answers":["parents"],"bank":["sisters","children","parents"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Their girl is their","after":".","answers":["daughter"],"bank":["daughter","son","brother"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"One boy and one girl — two","after":".","answers":["children"],"bank":["children","parents","wives"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"husband","ru":"муж","kk":"күйеу","def":"Her husband is an engineer.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/c3f51e5ad5fb.mp3"},{"en":"wife","ru":"жена","kk":"әйелі","def":"Aideen is my brother's wife.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/2aec6368df0e.mp3"},{"en":"grandparents","ru":"бабушка и дедушка","kk":"ата-әже","def":"Derek and Carol are their grandparents.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/52aa395a52b7.mp3"},{"en":"married","ru":"женат / замужем","kk":"үйленген / тұрмыста","def":"Agneta is married.","img":"/course/a0/img/l5-married.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/52d081ef4d70.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Кто это?","sub":"","prompt":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/75cb691881bd.mp3","options":["grandmother","grandfather","father"],"answer":"grandfather","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Кто это?","sub":"","prompt":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/72bb5d6c3974.mp3","options":["mother","grandfather","grandmother"],"answer":"grandmother","html":""},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два предложения.","sub":"Оба говорят, чьё это.","items":[{"text":"This is my sister.","src":null},{"text":"Her name is Inga.","src":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"my, your, his, her…","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Лицо</th><th>Чей?</th><th>Пример</th></tr><tr><td>I</td><td>my</td><td>This is my mother.</td></tr><tr><td>you</td><td>your</td><td>What is your name?</td></tr><tr><td>he</td><td>his</td><td>His wife is a nurse.</td></tr><tr><td>she</td><td>her</td><td>Her son is two.</td></tr><tr><td>we</td><td>our</td><td>Our parents are here.</td></tr><tr><td>they</td><td>their</td><td>Their daughter is ten.</td></tr></table><p><b>his</b> — про мужчину, <b>her</b> — про женщину.</p><p>Слово после не меняется: <b>her</b> son, <b>his</b> son.</p><p><b>my / your / his…</b> всегда стоят перед человеком или предметом.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Окончание 's","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>Предложение</th><th>Значение</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Anna's father</td><td>the father of Anna</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>my brother's wife</td><td>the wife of my brother</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Xavier and Carmen's son</td><td>the son of two people</td></tr></table><p>Добавьте <b>'s</b> к тому, кому принадлежит: Anna<b>'s</b> father.</p><p>Сначала владелец, потом сам предмет.</p><p>Если владельцев двое, <b>'s</b> ставится только у последнего.</p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">Anna's здесь = «Анны», а не «Anna is».</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["This is my family.","Her name is Aygul.","His wife is a nurse.","Their daughter is ten.","Aideen is my brother's wife.","Anna's father is Derek."]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"This is Anna. ___ mother is Carol.","options":["His","Her","Their"],"answer":"Her","why":"Анна — женщина → her.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"This is Derek. ___ wife is Carol.","options":["Her","Their","His"],"answer":"His","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"Charlie and Anna. ___ son is Fergus.","options":["Their","His","Our"],"answer":"Their","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"My","after":"name is Shuang.","answers":["husband's"],"bank":["husband's","husbands","husband"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Aideen is my","after":"wife.","answers":["brother's"],"bank":["brother","brothers","brother's"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"","after":"parents are teachers.","answers":["My"],"bank":["My","I","Me"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"cols","title":"Один человек или двое?","sub":"","columns":["Один","Двое и больше"],"items":[{"text":"their","col":1},{"text":"his","col":0},{"text":"grandparents","col":1},{"text":"our","col":1},{"text":"my","col":0},{"text":"her","col":0}]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["This","sister.","my","is"],"answer":"This is my sister.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["two.","Her","son","is"],"answer":"Her son is two.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["is","brother","My","married."],"answer":"My brother is married.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["This","is","the","wife","of","my","brother."],"bad":2,"answer":"This is my brother's wife.","why":"Используйте 's: my brother's wife."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["Anna","is","here.","His","mother","is","Carol."],"bad":3,"answer":"Anna is here. Her mother is Carol.","why":"Анна — женщина → her."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["They","son","is","Fergus."],"bad":1,"answer":"Their son is Fergus.","why":"Перед человеком — their, а не they."},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Дерек — это Аннин…","src":"/course/a0/audio/46ea01009b35.mp3","options":["brother","father","son"],"answer":"father","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Чарли и Анна —","src":"/course/a0/audio/a85f866b49fd.mp3","options":["brother and sister","husband and wife","parents"],"answer":"husband and wife","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Andy and Anna are brother and","after":".","answers":["sister"],"bank":["sister","wife","daughter"],"src":"/course/a0/audio/8b458eeb247d.mp3"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Эйдин —","src":"/course/a0/audio/20882a3d37e0.mp3","options":["my brother's wife","my brother","my sister's wife"],"answer":"my brother's wife","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Сколько лет дочери?","src":"/course/a0/audio/e8c24280cdab.mp3","options":["two","ten","twelve"],"answer":"ten","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"My","after":"name is Shuang.","answers":["husband's"],"bank":["husband's","husbands","husband"],"src":"/course/a0/audio/fdc41544af2a.mp3"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Сколько сестёр?","src":"/course/a0/audio/f5e0146128ec.mp3","options":["one","two","three"],"answer":"two","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Их зовут:","src":"/course/a0/audio/f5e0146128ec.mp3","options":["Agneta and Inga","Anna and Olivia","Aideen and Inga"],"answer":"Agneta and Inga","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте про Кая.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Kai</p><p>Hi! I'm Kai.</p><p>This is my family. My father's name is Timur.</p><p>My mother is a teacher. Her name is Aygul.</p><p>I have one sister. Her son is my nephew — he is two.</p>"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Kai's father is Timur.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Kai</p><p>Hi! I'm Kai.</p><p>This is my family. My father's name is Timur.</p><p>My mother is a teacher. Her name is Aygul.</p><p>I have one sister. Her son is my nephew — he is two.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Kai has two sisters.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Kai</p><p>Hi! I'm Kai.</p><p>This is my family. My father's name is Timur.</p><p>My mother is a teacher. Her name is Aygul.</p><p>I have one sister. Her son is my nephew — he is two.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"","after":"mother is a teacher.","answers":["His"],"bank":["Their","His","Her"],"why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Kai</p><p>Hi! I'm Kai.</p><p>This is my family. My father's name is Timur.</p><p>My mother is a teacher. Her name is Aygul.</p><p>I have one sister. Her son is my nephew — he is two.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Напишите о своей семье.","sub":"Два человека и их имена.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>This is my ___ . ___ name is ___ .</li><li>My ___ is ___ years old.</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">This is my</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">mother</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">father</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">sister</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">brother</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">His</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Her</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">name is</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">is married</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>Я использовал(а) <b>my</b> перед человеком.</li><li>Я правильно использовал(а) <b>his</b> или <b>her</b>.</li><li>Имена — с заглавной буквы.</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"record","title":"Произнесите предложения. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"Сначала послушайте каждое предложение.","items":["This is my family.","Her name is Aygul.","My brother's wife is a teacher.","Their son is two."]},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Урок 5 пройден","sub":"Урок 5 из 24 · Юнит 2","items":["Я могу назвать членов своей семьи.","Я могу использовать my, his, her, their.","Я могу использовать 's: my brother's wife."]}]}
